            <h3
              class="login-form-title flex items-center gap-2 text-[clamp(1.65rem,4.5vh,2.25rem)] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.035em] text-slate-950 dark:text-white"
            >
              Student Login
            </h3>
            <h3
              class="hidden"
            >
              Welcome Back! 
              <span
                class="inline-block origin-bottom animate-bounce"
